        <p source="#source-119081-119137"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119081-119126" corresp="#source-119090-119126"><seg source="#source-119081-119090">（ａ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119126-119137">　閃光</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-119137-119214"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119137-119182" corresp="#source-119146-119182"><seg source="#source-119137-119146">（ｂ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119182-119214">　雨の降り注ぐ如き光</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-119214-119279"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119214-119259" corresp="#source-119223-119259"><seg source="#source-119214-119223">（ｃ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119259-119279">　細い光の帯</seg></p>
      </div>
