        <p source="#source-119314-119396"><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-22" source="#source-119314-119352">Ⅱ</g><seg source="#source-119352-119396">　一定の形を有し且つ動く光体</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-119396-119670" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p source="#source-119431-119487"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119431-119476" corresp="#source-119440-119476"><seg source="#source-119431-119440">（ｄ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119476-119487">　火球</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-119487-119543"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119487-119532" corresp="#source-119496-119532"><seg source="#source-119487-119496">（ｅ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119532-119543">　火柱</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-119543-119602"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119543-119588" corresp="#source-119552-119588"><seg source="#source-119543-119552">（ｆ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119588-119602">　火の棒</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-119602-119670"><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-119602-119647" corresp="#source-119611-119647"><seg source="#source-119602-119611">（ｇ）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-119647-119670">　ラッパ状の光</seg></p>
